 my focus on the theme of how  how and why a person of such tremendous  entrepreneurial  fame and fortune could become the most  virulent anti-semite of the 20th century  the first  answer to that question and i don't have  the complete tied up in a bow answer by  the way so i hope you're not going to  wait for that because there isn't any  but the first subtext i had to deal with  was that what was the history of  anti-semitism as a whole  just a just to sort of add to my agenda  so there's a term there's a whole  subtext in the book which is about  the  genesis and existence of anti-semitism  from medieval times  to the present day because i want to  show that ford's behavior  was not an anomaly it was part of a  tradition it was part of a  thousand year long 2000 year long  tradition through many different  cultures and many different  nationalities and many different forms  of belief  the second challenge that i felt i had  to  meet  was to figure out why  ford's propensity to focus on jews  was there one specific incident that  occurred in his childhood  was he you know  was his father  his father take out a loan and never  paid it back or was his farm repossessed  by a jewish landlord or something  cliched or stereotypical like that the  answer to that is no  um i was unable to find any  precipitating incident that  was sort of like the tipping point that  put forth into the into the anti-jewish  camp i found a combination of  circumstances which i just want to  very  schematically  provide to you  he grew up in a  very provincial  small town  outside of detroit  during a pop of the populist era of our  nation a very myopic  point of view in the community  he was schooled on the mcguffey readers  which i talked about in the very first  chapters of my book that's where he  picked up on a lot of the  stereotypical imagery of [ __ ]  and the jew as the  hoarder of money  the jew as the alien the jew as the  outsider  as he became more involved in his  corporate i