t  of a problem with  with that whole  issue that's true he accused jp morgan  to be a jewish banker uh the the  ford  in uh and this is interesting in light  of the changeover um  which has happened  in the last few weeks and at the company  um  in  the late teens or early 20s  um edsel  and mrs ford clara and henry ford bought  out all the other stockholders  and  assumed 100  ownership of the company  and  throughout  the 80 years since then  the ford there's obviously been a very  active ford presence  in the company and i didn't really under  know until some one told me recently  that they actually get together as  several members of the family or they  all get together occasionally just to  talk about what's going on it's a very  strong  sense of  ownership you know emotion perhaps it's  more emotional but still they have a  predominant voting  authority in the company but there's  always been that that's part of that is  part of the culture  the antipathy to bankers  really predates  the  the issuance of the car and the  promulgation of the car  and that goes back i think to one of the  as i said earlier one of the populist  credos about the rothschilds across the  water and the wire pullers and  the fact that there's really an economy  behind our economy you know the whole  there i also talk in my book at great  length about the founding of the federal  reserve system  in 1910 as you may know paul warburg  was the driving force behind that  he was jewish german jewish  and  ford actually came out at one time and  accused the federal reserve  of being in control by the jews and was  such caused such a furor that there was  a there was a proposed senate hearing  to examine this charge and they asked  for they challenged ford to come and  come up and defend himself  next question  i have one comment before i ask the  question  with respect to fought hiring jews  i know of at least two people  who in the 30s  sought jobs at ford  and in one case one of them  was